Package: cdex-base
Architecture: amd64
Depends: binfmt-support,
         dbus-x11,
         fontconfig,
         gtk2-engines-pixbuf,
         libnss-myhostname,
         libnss-resolve,
         lightdm,
         lightdm-gtk-greeter,
         openbox,
         polkitd,
         python3,
         spice-vdagent,
         systemd-resolved,
         wine (>= 10.0.1-1cd),
         wmctrl,
         x11-utils,
         x11-xserver-utils,
         xdotool,
         xorg,
         xterm,
         yad,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: CusDeb ReactOS Explorer desktop environment (base)
 Custom ReactOS Explorer shell, taskbar bridge, and supporting
 configuration for the CusDeb Win32 desktop. This package builds a
 selected subset of ReactOS from source and installs it together with
 the LightDM/Openbox session needed to run it under Wine.

Package: mspaint
Architecture: amd64
Depends: cdex-base, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ReactOS Paint
 mspaint.exe from ReactOS for the CusDeb Win32 desktop.

Package: cdex-calc
Architecture: amd64
Depends: cdex-base, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ReactOS Calculator
 calc.exe from ReactOS for the CusDeb Win32 desktop.

Package: winmine
Architecture: amd64
Depends: cdex-base, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ReactOS Minesweeper
 winmine.exe from ReactOS for the CusDeb Win32 desktop.

Package: spider
Architecture: amd64
Depends: cdex-base, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ReactOS Spider Solitaire
 spider.exe from ReactOS for the CusDeb Win32 desktop.

Package: cdex-full
Section: metapackages
Architecture: amd64
Depends: cdex-base,
         cdex-calc,
         mspaint,
         spider,
         winmine,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: CusDeb ReactOS Explorer desktop environment (full)
 Meta-package that installs the complete CusDeb Win32 desktop,
 including the ReactOS Explorer shell and all bundled applications.
